      "created_at": "2017-10-09T20:07:50Z",
      "updated_at": "2017-10-09T20:07:50Z",
      "body": "The blockchain already supports this. The blockchain does not require any personally identifiable information to use. Numerous individuals have set up accounts that anyone can use for anonymous use. I don't believe we need a special type of account specifically for this.",
