      "created_at": "2017-10-12T08:23:48Z",
      "updated_at": "2017-10-12T08:23:48Z",
      "body": "Null authority account, works fine.\r\nStill it is just a work around at user level. A much user friendly solution can be created at front-end level. But still the best solution, in my opinion, would be to implement it at the API level. (This API can internally use one, null authority account with high bandwidth or a pool of null authority accounts with normal bandwidths)",
